{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00576","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 絜诚 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 絜诚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂筵开玉俎，兰圃荐琼芳。\n八音调凤历，三献奉鸾觞。\n絜粢申大享，庭宇冀降祥。\n神其覃有庆，契福永无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00576.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00576","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}